Cell["\<\
The 6-cycle has six lines, one per antipodal pair of ends; a path has one.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"0af28ff9-79c4-4550-bcf4-06afe36a2d2f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"LineCount", "[", 
    RowBox[{"CycleGraph", "[", "6", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"LineCount", "[", 
    RowBox[{"PathGraph", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Range", "[", "5", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"d7755092-4519-49ec-b1f2-f9f3642f0579"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"6", ",", "1"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]= ",ExpressionUUID->"4fbf4889-2b6d-429e-8541-b458b4bab937"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["The 3 \[Times] 3 grid has twelve.", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"22dc0c17-bc22-45c9-a39b-fa49a28c1960"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"LineCount", "[", 
  RowBox[{"GridGraph", "[", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"64a81e59-c44e-4265-8a3a-a5b3da8955ac"],

Cell[BoxData["12"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"845a7331-66c8-4e83-b987-34d5487bb18f"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

